<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18946" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀωτ-έω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sleep,</i>
			
				Ep.
			 Verb, only pres., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί πάννυχον ὕπνον ἀωτεῖς;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.159
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηκέτι νῦν εὕδοντες ἀωτεῖτε γλυκὺν
					ὕπνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					10.548
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Simon.
				37.5
			</span></i>:—in <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀωτεύειν:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπανθίζεσθαι</span> (also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀωτεῖτε: ἀπανθίζετε τὸν ὕπνον</span>),
			but expld. by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑφαίνειν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				476
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i> s.v.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀωτεμεῖν</span> (sic); perh.
			to be read (in signf. <i>sleep</i>) in <i><span class="en">
				B.
				8.13
			</span></i> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσαγεύω.</span></div>
